        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saw II: Flesh & Blood, Saw 3D, Scream Queens\n- People: Kevin Greutert, Patrick Melton, Marcus Dunstan, Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, Cary Elwes, Gabby West\n- Topics: release timing, film production, casting\n\nFacts:\n- Saw 3D is a 2010 American 3D horror film.\n- Kevin Greutert directed Saw 3D.\n- Patrick Melton and Marcus Dunstan wrote Saw 3D.\n- Tobin Bell, Costas Mandylor, Betsy Russell, Sean Patrick Flanery, and Cary Elwes starred in Saw 3D.\n- Saw II: Flesh & Blood was released in 2010 to coincide with the release of Saw 3D one week later.\n- Gabby West won a role in Saw 3D through a competition on the reality show Scream Queens.",
